---
description: Conventions for adding or reviewing GMI Cloud inference code
alwaysApply: false
---

- Confirm the endpoint, model ID, and supported API in the [GMI Cloud inference docs](https://docs.gmicloud.ai/inference-engine/ie-intro).
- Keep API keys in server-side environment variables. Do not hard-code or log them, or put them in browser code.
- Mock the inference client in automated tests so checks do not require credentials or make billable requests.
